  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then everything is proceeding according to plan.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_084.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Was it also your plan to sacrifice the revivified tree?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-PRIM_061.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756060,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I never wanted to sacrifice any trees. When I finished the Song of Creation, magic calcified into the six core schools.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_085.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Eldritch's knowledge was dependent on applications of magic that no longer worked. Their civilization collapsed quickly.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_086.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I tried to aid them, once I was given the Eye of History. I gave them Spell Trees to guide them in creating new rites. They acted poorly.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_087.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So I stopped growing new Spell Trees for them.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_088.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But now you must reach the Bug Island. There is one you must rescue. Scholar Hadfield, I believe, already has an idea how.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Tree_BartlebyProjection_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Bartleby_AH-PRIM_089.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1756054,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What? No, I don't. Wait, yes I do. We can glide, like with the leaves. We just need something to glide on.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-PRIM_085.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1761075,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-PRIM-NPC22_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wizard, get some Feathers from the Albatross over there and meet me back here. Zander and I will gather some sticks.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Tarrak_Hadfield_AH-PRIM_086.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1761075,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
